POST http://localhost:3000/api/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{"usuario":"aprendiz01","contrasena":"Clave-SENA-2026!"}

### Login correcto (200)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"usuario":"aprendiz01","contrasena":"Clave-SENA-2026!"}

### Login con contraseña errónea (401)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

